---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="AI answers can be wrong. How to use the prompts and lessons on Jajati AI responsibly."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Disclaimer' }]}
  pageType="policy"
>
  <article class="container-ja max-w-3xl pt-6 md:pt-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold md:text-5xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="prose-ja mt-6">
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>AI can be wrong.</strong> Prompts help you get better answers, but AI tools still make mistakes and
          sometimes invent facts, links or sources. Check anything important yourself.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Educational content.</strong> The lessons and prompts are for learning. They are not legal, medical,
          financial or career advice.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Your data.</strong> Think before pasting personal, client or office information into any AI tool, and
          follow your school's or company's rules.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Results vary.</strong> The same prompt can give different answers on different tools, models or days.
          No result is guaranteed.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Independent.</strong> Jajati AI is not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI, Google, Anthropic or
          any other company named on the site. Names like ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude and NotebookLM belong to their owners.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Facts change.</strong> AI products change quickly. Facts are checked against the listed sources on
          the date of each episode.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
